      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie maeni gi dhanum’utuk pa Esau (ma en e Edom). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.26.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 26:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau gamu mon pare m’i kind nyir mi Kanan: Ada ma nyar Elon ma Jahiti, man Oholibama ma nyar Ana, ma nya Zibeon ma Jahivi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 28:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man Basemath ma nyar Icmael, ma nyamin Nebaioth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Ada nyolo Elifaz ni Esau; Basemath ke nyolo Reuel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man Oholibama nyolo Yeuc, man Yalam, man Kora: maeni gi wot Esau, ma junyolo ire i ng’om Kanan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Esau gamu mon pare, ku wote, ku nyige, ku dhanu ceke m’i ot pare, ku lim pare, man lim pare ceke mi ter, ku piny pare ceke, m’ecoko i ng’om Kanan; e ecidho i ng’om ma cen kud umin ma Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum piny migi bedo dit m’usagu ma gicopo bedo ko karacelo; man ng’om mir umondo migi romogi ngo kum lim migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Esau bedo wi got Seir: Esau en e Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E maeni gi dhanum’utuk pa Esau ma won Juedomi i got Seir: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maeni nying wot Esau: Elifaz ma wod Ada ma dhaku pa Esau, Reuel ma wod Basemath ma dhaku pa Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wot Elifaz gi Teman, Omar, Zefo, man Gatam, ku Kenaz. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Timna en e dhaku m’araga pa Elifaz ma wod Esau; man enyolo Amalek ni Elifaz; maeni gi wot Ada, ma dhaku pa Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni gi wot Reuel: Nahath, man Zera, Cama, man Miza: maeni gi wot Basemath, ma dhaku pa Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni gi wot Oholibama ma nyar Ana, ma nya Zibeon, ma dhaku pa Esau: enyolo Yeuc ni Esau, man Yalam, man Kora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni gi rwodhi mi wot Esau: wot Elifaz ma kayu pa Esau gi eni: rwoth Temen, rwoth Omar, rwoth Zefo, rwoth Kenaz, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rwoth Kora, rwoth Gatam, rwoth Amalek: maeni rwodhi m’uai ba Elifaz i ng’om Edom; maeni gi wot Ada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni gi wot Reuel, ma wod Esau: rwoth Nahath, rwoth Zera, rwoth Cama, rwoth Miza: maeni rwodhi m’uai ba Reuel i ng’om Edom; maeni gi wot Basemath, ma dhaku pa Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni gi wot Oholibama, ma dhaku pa Esau: rwoth Yeuc, rwoth Yalam, rwoth Kora: maeni gi rwodhi m’uai ba Oholibama ma nyar Ana, ma dhaku pa Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni gi wot Esau, man maeni gi rwodhi migi: ma en e Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni gi wot Seir ma Jahori, gi ju m’ubedo i ng’ombe: Lotan man Cobal ku Zibeon man Ana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man Dicon man Ezer ku Dican: maeni gi rwodhi m’uai ba Juhori, ma nyithindho pa Seir i ng’om Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man nyithindho pa Lotan gi Hori man Heman; man nyamin Lotan en e Timna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni gi nyithindho pa Cobal: Alvan man Manahath kud Ebal, Cefo man Onam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni gi nyithindho pa Zibeon: Aia man Ana; maeni Ana m’unwang’u kulo ma lieth i yamba, kinde m’ekwayu kana pa Zibeon ma won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni gi nyithindho pa Ana: Dicon man Oholibama ma nyar Ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni nyithindho pa Dicon: Hemdan man Ecban ku Ithran man Keran, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni gi nyithindho pa Ezer: Bilhan man Zavan kud Akan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni gi nyithindho pa Dican: Uz man Aran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni gi rwodhi m’uai ba Juhori: rwoth Lotan, rwoth Cobal, rwoth Zibeon, rwoth Ana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rwoth Dicon, rwoth Ezer, rwoth Dican: maeni gi rwodhi ma giai ba Juhori, calku rwodhi migi i ng’om Seir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man maeni gi ju m’ubimo m’ucamu ker i ng’om Edom, ma fodi ubimo moko kucamu ker ungo wi nyithindho mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Bela ma wod Beor ucamu ker i Edom; man nying adhura pare en e Dinhaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Bela tho, man Yobab ma wod Zera m’i Bozra camu ker kakare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yobab utho, man Hucam m’i ng’om Jutemani camu ker kakare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Hucam utho, man Hadad ma wod Bedad, m’ugoyo Midian i podho pa Moab, ucamu ker kakare: man nying adhura pare Avith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Hadad utho, man Samla m’i Masreka camu ker kakare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Samla tho, man Caul m’i Rehoboth i ng’et Kulo camu ker kakare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Caul utho, man Bal-hanan ma wod Akbor ucamu ker kakare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Bal-hanan ma wod Akbor utho, e Hadar ucamu ker kakare: man adhura pare en e Pau; man nying’ dhaku pare en e Mehetabel, ma nya Matred, ma nya Mezahab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni gi nying’ rwodhi m’uai bang’ Esau, calku wat migi, calku kakagi, ku nying’gi ku nying’gi: rwoth Timna, rwoth Alva, rwoth Yetheth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rwoth Oholibama, rwoth Ela, rwoth Pinon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rwoth Kenaz, rwoth Teman, rwoth Mibzar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 36:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rwoth Magdiel, rwoth Iram: maeni gi rwodhi pa Edom, calku kabedo migi i ng’om mi piny migi. Maeni en e Esau, ma won Juedomi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.36.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.36.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
